                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَمْشُوقٌ</span></b> 
                         A man <i>light of flesh:</i> (K:) a horse
<i>lean, lank, light of flesh, slender, or lank in the
belly.</i> (S.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَمْشُوقَةٌ</span> A damsel <i>tall and
